@{
	ViewBag.Title = "FAQ";
}

<div id="view-faq" class="content">
    <div class="two_third floatleft">
        <h3>Frequently asked questions</h3>
        <h4>Can I build a recipe?</h4>
        <p>Yes. The recipe builder supports new recipes, cloning, editing, and BeerXML import/export.</p>

        <h4>Can I share recipes?</h4>
        <p>Yes. Public recipe pages include share links, clone actions, print, and BeerXML export.</p>

        <h4>What still needs work?</h4>
        <p>The legacy stack still has some rough edges, but the core recipe flows are now stable again.</p>
    </div>
</div>
